Solution -1:

Initialise array for frequency of characters
initialise maxfrequency and maxlength
iterate each character in for loop
Add every character's frequency (arr[ch-'A']++)
calculate maxfrequency by comparing with arr[ch-'A']
to calculate the characters need to be change is :
      change => length of characters still now processed (right-left+1) - maximumfrequency of a single character
while the change is greater than k 
derement the character which processed by the left pointer
and calculate maximum frequency each time by comparing all the 26 values in the frequency array
and finally calculate maximumlength by comparing the length of the string till now processed
return maxlen

Time complexity :
O(26 * (N+N))   =>  O(N)

